  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Shadow Lightning\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Shadow-lightning.png\" title=\"Image:Shadow-lightning.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Shadow-lightning.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Shadow-lightning.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Mage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Unknown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Deals Shadow damage.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Strikes a target with a powerful bolt of lightning, which leaps to up to 5 enemies and deals Shadow Damage.\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> 1.5 seconds.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Deals X Shadow Damage to up to 5 enemies.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 3\n</td><td> 8\n</td><td> 13\n</td><td> 18\n</td><td> 23\n</td><td> 28\n</td><td> 33\n</td><td> 38\n</td><td> 43\n</td><td> 48\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 11-80\n</td><td> 26-185\n</td><td> 41-291\n</td><td> 56-396\n</td><td> 71-501\n</td><td> 86-607\n</td><td> 101-712\n</td><td> 116-817\n</td><td> 131-923\n</td><td> 146-1028\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 95.5\n</td><td> 138.0\n</td><td> 180.5\n</td><td> 223.1\n</td><td> 265.6\n</td><td> 308.1\n</td><td> 350.6\n</td><td> 393.1\n</td><td> 435.7\n</td><td> 478.2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 3340\n</td><td> 8908\n</td><td> 14476\n</td><td> 20044\n</td><td> 25613\n</td><td> 31181\n</td><td> 36749\n</td><td> 42317\n</td><td> 47885\n</td><td> 53453\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">15\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">16\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">17\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">18\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">19\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 53\n</td><td> 58\n</td><td> 63\n</td><td> 68\n</td><td> 73\n</td><td> 78\n</td><td> 83\n</td><td> 88\n</td><td> 93\n</td><td> 98\n</td></